<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p><strong><%= @portfolio_company.investor_name %></strong> has submitted their KPI report for the period ending <strong><%= l @kpi_report.as_of %></strong>.</p>

<p>You can review the report by clicking the link below:</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Review KPI Report', kpi_report_url(@kpi_report, host: @entity.sub_domain + '.' + ENV.fetch('DOMAIN', 'localhost')), class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %></p>

<p>Thank you,<br><%= @entity.name %> System</p>
